)."},{"tag":"f03_dark_green","text":"Dark-and-green detector: negative smoothed luminance plus a green term. Forest is dark green; Pasture is bright green; urban is bright, so this orders Forest > Pasture > urban."},{"tag":"f04_BR_smooth","text":"Smoothed blue-minus-red: water reflects blue and absorbs red; positive on River/SeaLake, negative on roofs and soil."},{"tag":"f05_blue_dark","text":"Blue dominance combined with low brightness: deep/clear water (SeaLake) is dark and blue-tinted, distinguishing it from bright blue-grey industrial roofs."},{"tag":"f06_blue_texture","text":"Centre-surround on the blue/green channels: small on smooth water surfaces, large on ripples, shorelines and river banks; separates River (textured, banked) from SeaLake (flat)."},{"tag":"f07_sobel_x","text":"Luminance Sobel-x: vertical edges of roads, building walls and lot boundaries (Highway, Industrial)."},{"tag":"f08_sobel_y","text":"Luminance Sobel-y: horizontal edges of roads and building rows."},{"tag":"f09_diag45","text":"Luminance 45-degree edge detector for oblique roads and plot boundaries."},{"tag":"f10_diag135","text":"Luminance 135-degree edge detector (complements filter 9 so any road orientation is covered)."},{"tag":"f11_hline","text":"Horizontal ridge detector (bright row between dark rows) with a small green-red term: periodic crop rows and furrows of Annual/Permanent Crop."},{"tag":"f12_vline","text":"Vertical ridge detector, the 90-degree partner of filter 11 for crop rows and tree lines in orchards."},{"tag":"f13_dline","text":"Diagonal ridge detector with a red-brown term: diagonal furrows, ploughed-soil stripes and vineyard rows (Permanent Crop)."},{"tag":"f14_spot","text":"Luminance centre-surround spot detector with a red-brown bias: bright isolated roofs on darker streets; dense Residential areas produce many such spots."},{"tag":"f15_corner","text":"Corner detector (bright quadrant vs rest) with a red-roof bias: building corners and rectangular footprints typical of Residential and Industrial blocks."}],"runs":[{"init":"fable","seed":0,"test":0.9094444444444445,"val":[0.6217,0.7719,0.7369,0.8037,0.7631,0.837,0.8396,0.8528,0.867,0.8504,0.8715,0.8917,0.8793,0.8943,0.8959,0.9013,0.8983,0.8976,0.8954,0.8969]},{"init":"fable","seed":1,"test":0.9092592592592592,"val":[0.6378,0.7528,0.7346,0.7663,0.8498,0.8333,0.8043,0.8563,0.8522,0.8635,0.872,0.8898,0.8641,0.8743,0.8887,0.8957,0.8937,0.9056,0.9004,0.9006]},{"init":"fable","seed":2,"test":0.9055555555555556,"val":[0.683,0.7702,0.7385,0.7485,0.7685,0.7933,0.8385,0.8283,0.8596,0.8896,0.873,0.8659,0.875,0.9007,0.8861,0.8967,0.9015,0.8974,0.902,0.8993]},{"init":"kaiming","seed":0,"test":0.9081481481481481,"val":[0.6609,0.7381,0.7604,0.7396,0.802,0.8381,0.8257,0.8583,0.8435,0.863,0.8356,0.8869,0.8909,0.8978,0.8965,0.9039,0.9017,0.9009,0.8978,0.8974]},{"init":"kaiming","seed":1,"test":0.9038888888888889,"val":[0.6785,0.6715,0.6685,0.7169,0.833,0.8157,0.807,0.8369,0.8596,0.8407,0.8594,0.898,0.8826,0.8683,0.8841,0.8943,0.8961,0.8956,0.9013,0.8946]},{"init":"kaiming","seed":2,"test":0.8985185185185185,"val":[0.6111,0.7678,0.69,0.7746,0.7867,0.7509,0.8439,0.8206,0.8328,0.8476,0.8539,0.8465,0.8691,0.8824,0.8639,0.8876,0.8941,0.8943,0.8948,0.8954]}]}